Stalwart's first start registers its web interface (admin and account
pages) with a URL to download it from: the latest webui.zip of
stalwartlabs/webui on GitHub. FenrirOS builds that web interface from
source in the same package (/usr/share/stalwart/webui.zip); this points the
default at the local file, so the server needs no download for its own
interface and runs the version packaged with it. The URL can still be
changed in the web interface (Applications). Written for FenrirOS.

--- a/crates/common/src/manager/defaults.rs	2026-11-12 19:13:56.654981627 -0500
+++ b/crates/common/src/manager/defaults.rs	2026-11-12 19:13:56.656938483 -0500
@@ -63,7 +63,7 @@
                     enable: true,
                     #[cfg(not(feature = "dev_mode"))]
                     resource_url:
-                        "https://github.com/stalwartlabs/webui/releases/download/v2/webui.zip"
+                        "file:///usr/share/stalwart/webui.zip"
                             .into(),
                     #[cfg(feature = "dev_mode")]
                     resource_url: "file://../webui/.ignore/webui.zip".into(),
